  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comprehensive Community Prevention and Continuum of Care Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID/Botswana seeks to support Comprehensive Community Prevention and Continuum of Care (C4) Project in furtherance of the Government of Botswanas (G OB) efforts to revitalize Primary Health Care (PHC) at the community level in Botswana, strengthen social services s ystems, and facilitate a sustained and equitable HIV response for all populations with a specific focus on key populations (KP), prior ity populations including adolescent girls and young women, orphans and vulnerable children (OVC), and men.</narrative>
  </description>
